    {
      "text": "标题为“Timeline of SPDX Evolution - Use Case by Use Case”的时间轴图，左下角有“MITRE”标志，页脚为“(c) 2024 The MITRE Corporation. All rights reserved. Approved for Public Release; Distribution Unlimited. Case No: 23-01614-54”。一排蓝色箭头段标有年份和版本：2010“SPDX begins”、2011“SPDX 1.0”、2013“SPDX 1.2”、2015“SPDX 2.0”、2018“2.1 to ISO”、2019、2020、2021“SPDX 2.3”、2022、2023“SPDX 3rc1”、2024+“SPDX 3.0”。箭头下方：2010“Standardized Single Package Information: Machine and human readable formats”；2011“Compliance Use Cases: Additional Project and License Information”；2013“Package Relations: 30+ additional use cases supported for complex packaging relationships and distribution scenarios”；2015“Security use cases: External references for vulnerabilities and product identification”；2020“SPDX & 3T-SBOM efforts merge: SPDX revises charter as an SDO”；2021“Free ISO Standard: ISO/IEC 5962 SPDX available”及“ISO/IEC 5962:2021”封面缩略图；2022“Format Interoperability”及 CDx 与 SPDX 标志；2023“Profiles: New areas of use cases: Build, Data, Security, AI, Lite”；2024+“Profiles: New areas of use cases: Services, Hardware, Safety”。箭头上方：“I AM THE Cavalry”标志配“Legislation: proposed software transparency, updatability & bill of material as reqts in safety critical sectors (automotive & healthcare)”；NTIA 印章配“NTIA: Software Transparency begins”；OMG 与 CISQ 标志配“3T-SBOM: OMG/CISQ begins w/ CONOPs for Tool-to-Tool SBOM”；2020 年处的两个竖排标签“SPDX 3.0 initial draft”和“3T-SBOM initial draft”；带“Transition of SBOM work to DHS”的印章；“Executive Order on Improving the Nation's Cybersecurity”缩略图配“Executive Order 14028”；以及带“EU Cyber Resilience Act”的文档缩略图。",
